docs {
  # Submit ASH Registration
  
  Registers a new student into the ASH programme. Accepts a multipart form that includes student bio-data, academic information, parental/guardian contacts, household details, and required file uploads (passport photo and parent signature).
  
  On success, the student record is inserted into the database and cached. The endpoint returns the newly created student object with a `201 Created` status.
  
  ## Authorization
  No authentication is required for this endpoint (public form submission).
  
  ## Request Body (`multipart/form-data`)
  
  ### Programme & Personal Details
  
  | Field           | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                                                 |
  |-----------------|--------|----------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | programType     | string | Yes      | One of: `ONLINE`, `OFFLINE`                                                                  |
  | firstName       | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                               |
  | middleName      | string | No       | Optional text                                                                                |
  | surname         | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                               |
  | gender          | string | Yes      | One of: `MALE`, `FEMALE`                                                                     |
  | age             | number | Yes      | Integer between `6` and `18` (inclusive)                                                     |
  | dob             | date   | Yes      | ISO date string — e.g. `2003-03-03` should follow `YYYY-MM-DD` format                                                       |
  | primaryLanguage | string | Yes      | One of: `ENGLISH`, `IGBO`, `HAUSA`, `YORUBA`, `PIDGIN ENGLISH`, `OTHER`                     |
  | homeAddress     | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                               |
  | studentPhone    | string | No       | Optional phone number                                                                        |
  
  ### Academic Information
  
  | Field                 | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                                                                               |
  |-----------------------|--------|----------|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | schoolName            | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                                             |
  | schoolTown            | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                                             |
  | schoolLga             | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                                             |
  | schoolState           | string | Yes      | Valid Nigerian state name (e.g. `ABIA`, `LAGOS`, `FCT`, etc.)                                                              |
  | currentClass          | string | Yes      | One of: `PRIMARY 3`, `PRIMARY 4`, `PRIMARY 5`, `PRIMARY 6`, `JSS1`, `JSS2`, `JSS3`, `SS1`, `SS2`, `SS3`                  |
  | classPositionLastTerm | string | Yes      | Non-empty text (e.g. `2`, `5th`)                                                                                          |
  | prevAfterschoolProgram| string | Yes      | One of: `YES`, `NO`                                                                                                        |
  | reasonForJoining      | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                                             |
  
  ### Parent / Guardian Information
  
  | Field                | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                                                                 |
  |----------------------|--------|----------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | fathersName          | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                               |
  | fathersPhone         | string | No       | Optional phone number                                                                                        |
  | fathersOccupation    | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                               |
  | mothersName          | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                               |
  | mothersPhone         | string | Yes      | Non-empty phone number                                                                                       |
  | mothersOccupation    | string | No       | Optional text                                                                                                |
  | guardianName         | string | No       | Optional text                                                                                                |
  | guardianRelationship | string | No       | One of: `BROTHER`, `SISTER`, `AUNTY`, `UNCLE`, `GRANDMOTHER`, `GRANDFATHER`, `COUSIN`, `OTHER` (optional)   |
  | guardianPhone        | string | No       | Optional phone number                                                                                        |
  | guardianOccupation   | string | No       | Optional text                                                                                                |
  
  ### Household & Learning Details
  
  | Field                | Type    | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                                                                                     |
  |----------------------|---------|----------|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | householdIncomeRange | string  | No       | One of: `NO STABLE INCOME`, `< ₦100K`, `₦100K-₦300K`, `₦300K-₦600K`, `₦600K-₦1M` (optional)                                  |
  | hasLearningCondition | string  | Yes      | One of: `YES`, `NO`, `NOT SURE`                                                                                                  |
  | learningConditions   | array   | No       | Array of: `LEARNING DIFFICULTY`, `VISION IMPAIRMENT`, `HEARING IMPAIRMENT`, `ATTENTION DIFFICULTY`, `PHYSICAL DISABILITY`, `OTHER` |
  
  ### Consent & Declaration
  
  | Field                | Type    | Required | Constraints                              |
  |----------------------|---------|----------|------------------------------------------|
  | parentConsent        | boolean | Yes      | Must be `true`. Defaults to `false`.     |
  | declarationConfirmed | boolean | Yes      | Must be `true`. Defaults to `false`.     |
  
  ### Administrative Fields (Internal Use)
  
  | Field          | Type   | Required | Constraints                        |
  |----------------|--------|----------|------------------------------------|
  | assignedMentor | string | No       | Optional — assigned after intake   |
  | pretestScore   | number | No       | Optional numeric score             |
  
  ## File Uploads
  
  | Field           | MIME Types Accepted        | Required | Notes                                      |
  |-----------------|----------------------------|----------|--------------------------------------------|
  | passportPhoto   | `image/*` (JPEG, PNG, etc.)| **Yes**  | Uploaded to `/Cedarrise Initiative/ASH-ASSETS/PASSPORTS` on Cloudinary |
  | lastResult      | PDF, image                 | No       | Student's last school result. Uploaded to `/Cedarrise Initiative/ASH-ASSETS/RESULTS`  |
  | parentSignature | `image/*` (JPEG, PNG, etc.)| **Yes**  | Uploaded to `/Cedarrise Initiative/ASH-ASSETS/SIGNATURES` on Cloudinary |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`201 Created`** — Returns the newly created ASH student record.
  
  The created record is also cached under the key `cedarrise:ash:ashStudent:<id>` using the `FORM_DATA` TTL.
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status | Description                                                                 |
  |--------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`        | Validation failed — missing required fields or invalid enum values. |
  | `400 Bad Request`        | No files were attached to the request.                              |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Cloudinary upload failed for `passportPhoto` or `parentSignature`. |
}
